{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00564","headline":"郊庙歌辞 蜡百神乐章 雍和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 蜡百神乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缇龠劲序，玄英晚候。\n姬蜡开仪，豳歌入奏。\n蕙馥雕俎，兰芬玉酎。\n大享明只，永绥多佑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}